@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5224

### Crea un prodotto valido → 201
# @name createProduct
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tastiera",
  "price": 49.90,
  "description": "Meccanica"
}

### Crea con nome vuoto → 400
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": 10,
  "description": null
}

### Leggi per id → 200
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json

### Leggi un id inesistente → 404
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Lista con default → 200, array (anche vuoto)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/products?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Lista con page/pageSize non validi → 400
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/products?page=0&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Aggiorna un prodotto esistente → 200
PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tastiera Pro",
  "price": 59.90,
  "description": "Meccanica RGB"
}

### Aggiorna con dati non validi → 400
PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -5,
  "description": null
}

### Aggiorna un id inesistente → 404
PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fantasma",
  "price": 1,
  "description": null
}

### Cancella → 204
DELETE {{Api_HostAddress}}/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}

### Cancella di nuovo lo stesso id → 404
DELETE {{Api_HostAddress}}/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}